// Source fixtures: circuitpython-source/src/apps/Orion/modules/arp.py with core/note_array.py,
// core/utils.py, core/music.py and adafruit_ticks (2**29 wrap). Traces live in
// fixtures/t09e_source_traces.inc, generated by fixtures/t09e/gen_traces.py under python -I.
// Trace functions named trace_dev_* carry the documented release-safety deviation; each step
// checks the C++ result and that the source result differs where the generator recorded it.
